  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Following a formal ethics hearing, the Indonesian National Police (Polri) announced the dishonorable discharge of Brigjen Tedjo Kusumo. The disciplinary action stems from his involvement in an alleged treason case. According to reports, investigators found that while serving as the Director of Intelligence for Densus 88, Tedjo Kusumo allegedly directed unauthorized surveillance of government officials, involving other officers including those with the ranks of Kombes and Kompol. The police have also processed specific physical evidence related to the case, which reportedly includes items marked with the slogans IndonesiaSadar and One Peace. Following the ruling, the former officer has submitted a formal appeal against his termination from the service. The proceedings and the subsequent dismissal have been widely covered by Indonesian media outlets as the investigation into these security-related allegations continues.",
